\item Definition of universally bounded fibres. Definition definition-universally-bounded of this chapter, cited at proof lines 397-399. Fixes what n bounds: degrees of Spec(k) x\_X U over Spec(k) for all field points.
\item Degree boundedness descends along flat surjective morphisms of schemes. Morphisms, Lemma morphisms-lemma-universally-bounded-permanence, cited at proof lines 411-413. The imported scheme-side permanence: if the source of a flat surjective morphism has degree <= n over k, so does the target.
